  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partners for Water (PVW3) 2011 - 2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Partners for Water 3 programme and its successors, are carried out by the Netherlands Enterprise Agency in cooperation with the Netherlands Water Partnership.Partners for Water 2011-2015 contributes towards the International Water Ambition of the Netherlands government. The goal of the International Water Ambition is to provide water safety and water security in urban deltas and its supply systems. Additionally, it aims to increase the Dutch share in providing water safety and water security in urban deltas.Partners for Water issues grants as well as contracts. Funding for this programme is provided by the Netherlands Ministry of Infrastructure and Water Management as opposed to other programmes reporting in the Project Database, which are funded by the Netherlands Ministry of Foreign Affairs.Url = https://projects.rvo.nl/For more information: Partners for WaterUrl = https://partnersforwater.nl/</narrative>
  </description>
